                <pb facs="0951" n="835" sameAs="frus:frus1923v01/pg835"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.1828/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Davis</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-03-31T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 31,
                                1923—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Legation’s no. 19. This Government would be pleased to have canal protocol
                    ratified but you should not make any representations to secure action to that
                    end.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
